{
  "type": "section",
  "name": "Chapter 1: Character Options",
  "id": "006",
  "page": 7,
  "entries": [
    {
      "type": "image",
      "href": {
        "type": "internal",
        "path": "book/AU/002-01-001.ch-1-splash.webp"
      },
      "width": 1700,
      "height": 2208,
      "title": "When magic is involved, a hero's journey can take infinite paths.",
      "credit": "Billy Christian"
    },
    "This chapter is full of new character options you can use to make characters suited to magical settings. The pages that follow include new and revised subclasses, new backgrounds, and new feats.",
    {
      "type": "section",
      "name": "Subclasses",
      "id": "007",
      "page": 7,
      "entries": [
        "This chapter presents eight new subclasses that are particularly appropriate for characters in settings that emphasize magic:",
        {
          "type": "list",
          "page": 7,
          "style": "list-no-bullets",
          "items": [
            "{@class Cleric|XPHB|Arcana Domain (Cleric)|Arcana|AU}: A Cleric of a divine force who understands the secrets and potential of magic intimately",
            "{@class Fighter|XPHB|Arcane Archer (Fighter)|Arcane Archer|AU}: A Fighter who draws on a unique tradition of elven archery to weave magic into their attacks",
            "{@class Monk|XPHB|Warrior of the Mystic Arts (Monk)|Mystic Arts|AU}: A Monk who wields magic to supplement their martial skill",
            "{@class Warlock|XPHB|Vestige Patron (Warlock)|Vestige|AU}: A Warlock who draws on the power of a dying god",
            "{@class Wizard|XPHB|Conjurer (Wizard)|Conjurer|AU}: A Wizard who has mastered the arts of teleportation and summoning spirit allies",
            "{@class Wizard|XPHB|Enchanter (Wizard)|Enchanter|AU}: A Wizard who has become an expert in clouding and captivating minds",
            "{@class Wizard|XPHB|Necromancer (Wizard)|Necromancer|AU}: A Wizard who can manipulate and draw magic from life, death, and undeath",
            "{@class Wizard|XPHB|Transmuter (Wizard)|Transmuter|AU}: A Wizard who has mastered modifying energy and matter"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "insetReadaloud",
          "id": "008",
          "page": 7,
          "entries": [
            {
              "type": "quote",
              "entries": [
                "Mystra's gifts range from subtle to earthshakingly powerful. Infuse your day with a little magic or stop a mighty villain from causing suffering—or both. When you study magic, your options are unlimited."
              ],
              "by": "Alustriel"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
