      "id": "079",
      "page": 20,
      "entries": [
        "This section presents ten backgrounds using the same format as those in the {@book Player's Handbook|XPHB|4|Background Descriptions}. These backgrounds are listed in the Backgrounds table. Descriptions of the Origin feats granted by each background can be found later in this chapter.",
        "Nine of these backgrounds connect characters to magical factions presented in chapter 4. These backgrounds describe the training associated with a faction but aren't required for affiliation with or membership in that faction.",
